{"title": "BC Conservative MLA Resigns from Caucus, Citing Leadership Issues", "summary": "Linda Hepner, MLA for Surrey-Serpentine River, resigned from the BC Conservative caucus on Sunday. She criticized the party leadership's \"willingness to listen\" and described their actions as \"beyond the pale.\"", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "बीसी कंजर्वेटिव एमएलए ने नेतृत्व संबंधी मुद्दों का हवाला देते हुए पार्टी व्हिप से इस्तीफा दिया", "summary_hi": "सूरी-सर्पेन्टाइन रिवर की एमएलए, लिंडा हेपनर ने रविवार को बीसी कंजर्वेटिव व्हिप से इस्तीफा दे दिया। उन्होंने पार्टी नेतृत्व की \"सुनने की इच्छा\" की आलोचना की और उनके कार्यों को \"अशोभनीय\" बताया।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Emphasized the resignation of Linda Hepner from the BC Conservative caucus.", "Highlighted her criticism of the party leadership's \"willingness to listen.\"", "Included her description of the leadership's actions as \"beyond the pale.\""]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["बीसी कंजर्वेटिव व्हिप से लिंडा हेपनर के इस्तीफे पर जोर दिया गया।", "पार्टी नेतृत्व की \"सुनने की इच्छा\" की उनकी आलोचना को उजागर किया गया।", "नेतृत्व के कार्यों को \"अशोभनीय\" बताने के उनके विवरण को शामिल किया गया।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://globalnews.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hepner-linda.jpg?quality=65&strip=all", "sources": [{"source": "Toronto Star", "owner": "Toronto Star", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Federalists say Alberta's Conservative MPs are missing in action as separation referendum looms"}, {"source": "Global News (Canada)", "owner": "Global News (Canada)", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://globalnews.ca/news/12066244/bc-conservatives-lose-another-mla-linda-hepner", "headline": "Another MLA leaves BC Conservative caucus as potential snap election looms"}, {"source": "CTV News", "owner": "CTV News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.c